Persian Translation
-------------------

This repository contains a Persian translation and adaptation of
"Beyond Coding" by David Tuffley.

Unless otherwise noted, the original translation contributions in this
repository are made available under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0).

